<p>The <strong class="selflink">placeable_basetypes 2da</strong> defines the values used in the <b>BaseType</b> column in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Placeable%20types%202da" title="Placeable types 2da">placeable_types 2da</a>.
</p><p>Placeable_basetypes is not listed in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%202da" title="M2DA 2da (page does not exist)">M2DA_base 2da</a> and as not been assigned a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_*</a> constant.
</p>
